format 1

# pipelith's own registry: the workflows this repository's CI runs,
# rendered by `actlith gen` (nix T30, dogfood). The gate kind runs the hk
# gate with the pr0d1r2 cache on the three systems whose dev shell has the
# gate's tools: pklith has no x86_64-darwin build, so that shell lacks them
# and the gate cannot run there (nix C).

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|x86_64-linux, aarch64-linux, aarch64-darwin|pr0d1r2|-
